msgstr "A rendszergazda 2FA-t ír elő ehhez a szerepkörhöz."

#. translators: %d: number of days remaining
#: includes/class-segurium-2fa.php:1133
msgid ""
"Your administrator requires two-factor authentication. You have %d day(s) "
